Theorem harness_iface_ok : harness_deps -> lib_iface_ok (PQTS.TopLay L) SCFG HI PQTS.TopLS.
Proof. intros D. apply (PQTS.top_iface_ok SCFG L HI LY). exact (harness_call_ok D). Qed.

